 "remarks": "Fantastic downtown location within walking distance to the town center, train station, and park! This spacious townhouse-style duplex offers the comfort and privacy of a single-family home.  The updated kitchen features granite countertops, a Sub-Zero refrigerator, and a Miele dishwasher. The open living and dining area leads directly to a charming outdoor terrace and a private, garden-style backyard-perfect for relaxing or entertaining. All bedrooms are conveniently located on the second floor, along with a beautifully renovated brand new full bathroom. The finished basement provides valuable additional living space and includes a fully renovated bathroom, cedar closet, and laundry room.  Enjoy the convenience of an attached one-car garage, plus two additional off-street parking spaces. Move-in ready and ideally located, this exceptional home is waiting for its new tenants.",
